 "entries": {
  "First Wicker's Spark#001": {
   "src": "It's a muddied page detailing how to make a wicker man. It must have flown in from down below.",
   "dst": "それは、ウィッカーマンの作り方を詳しく記した、汚れだらけのページだ。きっと下の方から飛んできたに違いない。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#002": {
   "src": "To form such a wicker man, first one must show its purpose clearly. Choose a platform, and demarcate its corners with rock.",
   "dst": "そのようなウィッカーマンを作るには、まずその目的を明確に示さなければならない。土台を選び、{c2}その四隅を石で区切る{/}。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"",
   "note":"{c2}demarcate its corners with rock{/}"
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#003": {
   "src": "Afterwards, as per usual, a scaffold is erected upon a bed of hay, around which the wicker man is built.",
   "dst": "{c1}その後、いつものように、{c2}干し草のベッドの上に足場が組まれ{c1}、その周囲に{c2}ウィッカーマンが組み立てられる{c1}。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"",
   "note":"{c2}a scaffold is erected upon a bed of hay{/}, {c2}the wicker man is built{/}"
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#004": {
   "src": "Objects tied to what one wishes to forget are placed within the head. Then, as the wicker man burns, the memories scatter with the smoke...",
   "dst": "忘れたいことに関連する品々が頭の中に置かれる。そして、「ウィッカーマン」が燃え上がるにつれて、その記憶は煙とともに散っていく……",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#005": {
   "src": "It's instructions for making a wicker man. Re-read them?",
   "dst": "これは「ウィッカーマン」の作り方だ。もう一度読んでみる？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#006": {
   "src": "...while the most known type of wicker man is that made to punish wrongdoers and spies, there is another type - one to forget memories.",
   "dst": "…ウィッカーマンといえば、悪人やスパイを罰するために作られたものが最もよく知られているが、もうひとつ別の種類がある――それは、記憶を消し去るためのものだ。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#007": {
   "src": "There's plenty of lumber in the crate. You could probably construct a scaffold and still have some wood to spare.",
   "dst": "木箱には木材がたっぷり入っている。足場を組んでも、まだ余るくらいあるだろう。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#008": {
   "src": "It would be best to place a bed of hay if you're going to build the scaffold, though.",
   "dst": "とはいえ、足場を作るなら、{c2}干し草を敷いておく{/}のが一番だろう。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"",
   "note":"{c2}bed of hay{/}"
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#009": {
   "src": "You. You you look strange. Not like the the ones to patrol here. And with with a strange weapon.",
   "dst": "君。君、なんだか変な感じだ。ここでパトロールしてる連中とは違う。それに、変な武器まで持ってるし。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Fort Hegea Archer",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#010": {
   "src": "Maybe you can help help me. I am forced to stay here here and practice. Practice until I can speak speak and shoot correctly.",
   "dst": "もしかすると、あなたが私を助けてくれるかもしれません。私はここに留まって練習せざるを得ません。正しく話せるようになり、正しく撃てるようになるまで練習し続けなければなりません。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Fort Hegea Archer",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#011": {
   "src": "But the rock rock in the way is annoying. It blocks blocks my path to shoot! ! So.",
   "dst": "でも、邪魔な岩がうっとうしい。撃つための進路を塞いでいるんだ！！だから。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Fort Hegea Archer",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#012": {
   "src": "Maybe you can can help, if you are staying here too? You could go blow it it up, or something. I know know there are explosives somewhere in the camp.",
   "dst": "もしあなたもここに滞在しているなら、手伝ってくれるかな？ そこを爆破したり、何か手を打ったりできるんじゃない？ キャンプのどこかに爆薬があるのは知ってるんだ。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Fort Hegea Archer",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#013": {
   "src": "You already have have some TNT, right? You could go blow the rock rock up, with it.",
   "dst": "TNTはすでに持ってるよね？それを使って、あの岩を爆破しちゃえばいいんじゃない？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Fort Hegea Archer",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#014": {
   "src": "I can finally practice practice my archery properly now. I think think I will get started.",
   "dst": "ようやくアーチェリーをきちんと練習できるようになった。さっそく始めてみようと思う。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Fort Hegea Archer",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#015": {
   "src": "At least least, as soon as I am done practicing my speaking. For today today, there is still...",
   "dst": "少なくとも、正しく話す練習が終わり次第は。今日のところは、まだ……",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Fort Hegea Archer",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#016": {
   "src": "As the brooch comes into view, the memories seeped into it start to effloresce...",
   "dst": "ブローチが視界に入ると、そこに染み込んだ記憶が花開くように蘇り始める……",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#017": {
   "src": "...finally found you. You have a way of making yourself scarce, you know that?",
   "dst": "…やっと見つけたよ。君って、なぜかいつも姿を隠すのが上手いよね、知ってる？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Clan Member",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#018": {
   "src": "Ah. Hello, Kawri. Is something the matter for you to seek me out?",
   "dst": "ああ。やあ、 Kawri 。何か用事があったの？わざわざ私を探しに来たなんて。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Azael",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#019": {
   "src": "Orders from the clan. We're to meet at the Pyre tonight. There's apparently an important matter to discuss.",
   "dst": "一族からの命令だ。今夜、火葬台で集合することになっている。どうやら話し合うべき重要な用件があるらしい。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Kawri",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#020": {
   "src": "The Pyre... how come? If the meeting is to take place there, surely the other clans will also be attending?",
   "dst": "火葬台……どうして？ そこで会合が開かれるのなら、他の氏族もきっと出席するはずだろう？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Azael",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#021": {
   "src": "I wasn't filled in on the details. Just told to try and chase after some of the more fickle members of our clan for form's sake.",
   "dst": "詳しい事情は聞かされていなかった。ただ、形だけのために、一族の中でも特に気まぐれな連中を何人か追いかけてみるように言われただけだった。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Kawri",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#022": {
   "src": "So you don't even know why. Hm. And are we convening at the same time as usual?",
   "dst": "つまり、理由すらわからないってことね。ふむ。ところで、いつもと同じ時間に集まるの？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Azael",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#023": {
   "src": "Apparently, we'll be starting about a quarter of an hour later. Another clan has requested extra time for preparations.",
   "dst": "どうやら、開始は15分ほど遅れるようです。別の氏族から、準備のための追加時間を要請がありました。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Kawri",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#024": {
   "src": "I still have a few others to track down, so I can't stay long. I take it I can confirm your attendance?",
   "dst": "まだ他にもいくつか探さなければならないことがあるので、長くは居られません。ご出席は確定でよろしいでしょうか？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Kawri",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#025": {
   "src": "If it's a meeting by the Pyre, then who am I to say no? I'll be seeing you all there tonight.",
   "dst": "「火葬台のそばでの集まり」なら、私が断るわけにはいかない。今夜、そこで皆さんにお会いしましょう。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Azael",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#026": {
   "src": "As the pendant glimmers in the light, the memories seeped into it start to effloresce...",
   "dst": "ペンダントが光に照らされてきらめくにつれ、そこに染み込んだ記憶が花開いていく……",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#027": {
   "src": "Gikyo! Great to see ya! Are you up to hear some gossip? This one's got some bark to it, too...",
   "dst": "Gikyo ！久しぶりだね！ゴシップでも聞きたい？今回の話は、なかなか刺激的なんだよ……",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Clan Member",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#028": {
   "src": "Am I? You know my answer, so why ask? Go on, go on, it's been so boring today! Spill the beans!",
   "dst": "そうかな？ 私の答えは分かってるくせに、なんで聞くの？ さあ、早く、早く。今日は本当に退屈だったんだから！ さあ、話してくれ！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Gikyo",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#029": {
   "src": "Alright, alright. This one's from a clan member who knows another over in the Staghorn clan. So, get this...",
   "dst": "わかった、わかった。これは、スタッグホーン一族の別のメンバーを知っている一族の仲間からの話だ。で、聞いてくれよ……",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Clan Member",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#030": {
   "src": "Word on the wind there's that they saw one of their members, Ophir, doing something super odd.",
   "dst": "噂によると、メンバーの一人である Ophir が、すごく奇妙なことをしているところを目撃されたらしい。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Clan Member",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#040": {
   "src": "Wait, THAT Ophir? They're such a snooze, though! What, were they finally up for a card game for once?",
   "dst": "えっ、あの Ophir ？ でも、あいつらってすごくつまらないよね！ まさか、ついにカードゲームをする気になったの？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Gikyo",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#041": {
   "src": "No, no, don't misunderstand. This was odd even by our standards! So, the clan member saw some weird smoke, and over in it...",
   "dst": "いや、いや、誤解しないでください。これは私たちの基準からしても、かなり奇妙な出来事でした！ つまり、一族の一人が奇妙な煙を目撃したのですが、その煙の中からは……",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Clan Member",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#042": {
   "src": "Bam! Ophir, spinning and growing from the ground! And, though I can't be so sure, apparently they had some goop on their hand that they shook off, too!",
   "dst": "バム！ Ophir が地面から回転しながら現れた！それに、確かなことは言えないけど、どうやら彼らの手にも何かベタベタしたものがついていて、それを振り払ったみたいだ！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Clan Member",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#043": {
   "src": "Whuh? Hey now, you sure you heard that right? Maybe they just slipped at a mud pit while out patrolling?",
   "dst": "えっ？ ちょっと待って、本当にそう聞こえたの？ もしかして、パトロール中に泥沼で滑っただけじゃないの？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Gikyo",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#044": {
   "src": "Yeah, you'd think something like that, right? But apparently some OTHER Stag won't budge on it being true!",
   "dst": "そう、そんな風に見えるよね？でも、どうやら別のスタッグは、それが事実だと頑なに主張しているらしい！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Clan Member",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#045": {
   "src": "...hah. That really is one hell of a rumor! If you keep finding ones this spicy, I won't be able to one-up you!",
   "dst": "…はあ。それは本当にとんでもない噂だね！ これほど刺激的な噂を次々と見つけてくるなら、僕にはもう敵わないよ！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Gikyo",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#046": {
   "src": "You got that right! Well, I'll have to be off. See you later! You'd better have something to share then!",
   "dst": "その通り！ さて、そろそろ行かなきゃ。またね！ その時は、何か話してくれるものがあるといいね！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Clan Member",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#047": {
   "src": "...Ophir. That Ophir. Of the ones here, to think it'd be them?",
   "dst": "… Ophir 。あの Ophir か。ここにいる連中の中で、まさかあいつらだなんて？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Gikyo",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#048": {
   "src": "Do you want to construct the scaffold?",
   "dst": "足場を組み立てる？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#049": {
   "src": "The scaffold is built! But the lumber from the crate won't be enough to build the wicker. There might be more in the camp.",
   "dst": "足場が完成した！でも、木箱から出た木材だけではウィッカーを作るには足りない。{c2}キャンプ{/}にはもっとあるかもしれない。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"",
   "note":"{c2}in the camp{/}"
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#050": {
   "src": "It's constructed! Now for the finishing touches...",
   "dst": "完成した！ あとは最後の仕上げだ……",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#051": {
   "src": "The wicker is complete! Now, just to find something to light it. There should be some candles around that you could use.",
   "dst": "ウィッカーが完成した！あとは、これを灯すものを見つけるだけだ。どこかに使える{c2}ろうそく{/}があるはずだ。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"",
   "note":"{c2}candles{/}"
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#052": {
   "src": "There should be some candles around that you could use to light the wicker.",
   "dst": "その辺に、ウィッカーを灯すのに使える{c2}ろうそく{/}がいくつかあるはずだ。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"",
   "note":"{c2}candles{/}"
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#053": {
   "src": "As you lift the candle, a flicker of memories begins to effloresce...",
   "dst": "ろうそくを持ち上げると、記憶のきらめきが花開くように広がり始める……",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#054": {
   "src": "Is that Azael I see? What, why's this sly old fox showing up out in the open tonight?",
   "dst": "あれは Azael か？　えっ、なんでこの狡猾な老狐が今夜、人目につく場所に現れたんだ？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Gikyo",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#055": {
   "src": "Gikyo. It's good to see you too. Are you also headed to-",
   "dst": "Gikyo 。君に会えて嬉しいよ。君もそこへ行くの？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Azael",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#056": {
   "src": "Listen, listen, I got told some reeeal interesting gossip today, and that's why you'll get to hear it too!",
   "dst": "ねえ、ねえ、今日、超～面白いゴシップを聞いたの。だから、みんなにも教えてあげるね！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Gikyo",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#057": {
   "src": "Can we not discuss as we walk? Or is this something meant to be kept secret?",
   "dst": "歩きながら話せないものですか？それとも、これは秘密にしておくべきことなのでしょうか？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Azael",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#058": {
   "src": "Ha! What better way to talk than idly? So, so, get this. It's about Ophir. And from what I've heard... they slipped up.",
   "dst": "はっ！　のんびりと話すのに、これ以上の方法があるだろうか？　さて、さて、聞いてくれ。 Ophir の話なんだ。聞いたところによると……あいつら、ミスを犯したらしい。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Gikyo",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#059": {
   "src": "Oh? In what way did they slip up? I believed them to be the most diligent of our newest assignees...",
   "dst": "え？　一体どこでミスをしたんだ？　彼らは、新しく配属されたメンバーの中で最も勤勉な人たちだと思っていたのですが……",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Azael",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#060": {
   "src": "...okay. You may want to say this can't be true. But. At least one clan member saw them in the middle of changing. Thought you ought to know.",
   "dst": "……わかった。そんなことあり得ないと思うかもしれない。でもね。少なくとも一人は、彼らが着替えの最中だったところを目撃している。知っておいたほうがいいと思ったんだ。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Gikyo",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#061": {
   "src": "Ah. Wait, but then... that'd make anyone as paranoid as a clan member... Oh. Oh no.",
   "dst": "ああ。ちょっと待って、でもそれだと……誰でも一族のメンバーと同じくらい疑心暗鬼になってしまうじゃないか……おっと。やばい。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Azael",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#062": {
   "src": "Gikyo, are you aware that there's a meeting at the Pyre tonight?",
   "dst": "Gikyo、今夜火葬台で会議があるのを知ってるか？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Azael",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#063": {
   "src": "What? Must have slipped my ears! Or my mind! But this week's been so uneventful, so why now? Unless-",
   "dst": "えっ？　聞き逃したのかな！　それとも聞き間違えたのかな！　でも今週は特に何事もなかったのに、なぜ今になって？　まさか――",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Gikyo",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#064": {
   "src": "... you got it too. There's only one reason that a meeting by the Pyre would be called - someone is being made a statement.",
   "dst": "…君も気づいただろう。火葬台での集まりが開かれる理由はただ一つ――誰かに「メッセージ」が伝えられるためだ。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Azael",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#065": {
   "src": "What time is it? When's the meeting? Can we even make it before then to try and save Ophir?",
   "dst": "今何時？　会議はいつ？　それまでに間に合って、Ophir を救えるのかな？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Gikyo",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#066": {
   "src": "There's still- oh no. It's starting any time. Let's go, NOW! If we run, maybe we can still somehow smuggle them out!",
   "dst": "まだ……ああ、やばい。もうすぐ始まる。さあ、今すぐ行こう！ 走れば、なんとかこっそり持ち出せるかもしれない！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Azael",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#067": {
   "src": "As the wicker starts to burn, the memories burning away coalesce within you!",
   "dst": "ウィッカーが燃え始めると、燃え尽きゆく記憶があなたの心の中で一つにまとまっていく！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#068": {
   "src": "Well, given the severity of the crime, letting you indulge seems most fitting. You're quite the ardent orator, after all. After you!",
   "dst": "まあ、その罪の重大さを考えれば、君に思う存分語らせてあげるのが一番ふさわしいだろう。何しろ、君は実に熱のこもった演説家だからね。どうぞ、先に行って！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Clan Member",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#069": {
   "src": "TONIGHT, WE MEET BEYOND THE MIST",
   "dst": "今夜、私たちは霧の向こうで出会う",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Orator Caetal",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#070": {
   "src": "TO PURGE A TRAITOR FROM OUR MIDST;",
   "dst": "我らの仲間から裏切り者を一掃するために；",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Clan Members",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#071": {
   "src": "NO LONGER WILL THIS BEAST CONSPIRE",
   "dst": "この獣が陰謀を企てることは、もはやないだろう",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Clan Members",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#072": {
   "src": "ENGULFED WITHIN OUR WICKER PYRE;",
   "dst": "ウィッカーの火葬台に包み込まれて；",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Clan Members",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#073": {
   "src": "SO FAN THE FLAMES, AND WATCH IT SQUIRM-",
   "dst": "さあ、炎を煽って、もがく様子を見てやれ――",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Clan Members",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#074": {
   "src": "'TIL NOTHING MORE IS LEFT TO BURN!",
   "dst": "燃やすものが何も残らなくなるまで！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Clan Members",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#075": {
   "src": "BURN!",
   "dst": "燃えよ！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Clan Members",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#076": {
   "src": "BURN!!!",
   "dst": "燃えよ！！！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Clan Members",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#077": {
   "src": "BURN!!!!!!",
   "dst": "燃えよ！！！！！！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Clan Members",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#078": {
   "src": "...nothing. Nary a trace. Only ashes remain... We were too late.",
   "dst": "…何もない。痕跡すら残っていない。残っているのは灰だけだ……我々は手遅れだった。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Azael",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#079": {
   "src": "Damn it all! Damn the clans, damn these woods, and this blasted pyre! Jumping straight to putting them in a wicker man?!",
   "dst": "くそっ！一族も、この森も、そしてこの忌々しい火葬台もくそくらえだ！いきなりウィッカーマンの中に放り込むなんて？！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Gikyo",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#080": {
   "src": "You should have known this would happen the moment you heard Ophir's name. To a clan, few actions are worse than espionage.",
   "dst": "Ophir の名前を聞いたその瞬間、こうなることは分かっていたはずだ。一族にとって、スパイ行為ほど許しがたい行為はほとんどない。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Azael",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#081": {
   "src": "So what? It's not... as if... they could have KNOWN! It's not normal! Again, what kind of person would even SUGGEST a ritual burning for ANY situation?",
   "dst": "だから何？　まさか……彼らがそれを「知っていた」なんてことあるわけないだろう！　そんなの普通じゃない！　繰り返すが、どんな状況であれ、儀式的な焼却なんてことを提案する人間が一体どこにいるというんですか？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Gikyo",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#082": {
   "src": "\"Look at me, I'm Ophir! There's a tiny bit of smoke around me!\", and what, the clans just love the visual? They love it so much Ophir gets reduced to nothing BUT smoke?",
   "dst": "「ほら、僕だよ、 Ophir ！ 周りにほんの少し煙が立ってる！」って、まさか一族たちはそのビジュアルに夢中なんじゃないの？ あまりにも気に入ったせいで、 Ophir が煙だけにまで成り下がっちゃったってこと？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Gikyo",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#083": {
   "src": "And again, this meeting was inevitable the moment they saw Ophir. As long as those like us are forced into these roles, this will be our punishment for failing to perform them.",
   "dst": "そして、 Ophir を目にした瞬間、この出会いは避けられないものだった。私たちのような者たちがこうした役割を強いられている限り、その役割を果たせなかったことに対する罰は、これからも続くことになるだろう。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Azael",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#084": {
   "src": "You. You... ha! Hahahaha! You really think so? What, are the clans imprinting on you THAT much? You'd call this justified?",
   "dst": "お前。お前……はっ！ ハハハハ！ 本当にそう思うのか？ 何だよ、一族の影響がそこまで強く出てるのか？ こんなことを正当だなんて言えるのか？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Gikyo",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#085": {
   "src": "What a hoot! I daresay they only justify revenge against THEM! We'll see how the clan heads like it, grilled to a smoky finish...",
   "dst": "なんて笑えるんだ！　彼らへの復讐こそが正当化されるに違いない！　一族の長たちが、煙が立ち上るほど焼き上げられたその仕上がりを見て、どう思うか見てやろう……",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Gikyo",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#086": {
   "src": "When did I justify it? Yet again, the root of the problem is what WE are forced to do. Our appearance and existence defined by orders from the top...",
   "dst": "私がいつそれを正当化したというのか？　やはり、問題の根源は、私たちに強要されていることにある。私たちの姿や存在が、上からの命令によって決められているのだ……",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Azael",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#087": {
   "src": "...discarded at will, unable to even say WHO we are, lest our existence be scattered upon-",
   "dst": "……気ままに捨て去られ、自分たちが「誰」なのかさえ言い表すこともできず、まるで自分たちの存在が散り散りになってしまうのを恐れるかのように――",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Azael",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#088": {
   "src": "Didn't take you as one to wax poetic. So what do you propose? Betray Her Majesty? What choice do WE have?",
   "dst": "君がそんな詩的なことを口にするタイプだとは思わなかったな。じゃあ、どうするつもりだ？女王陛下を裏切るのか？俺たちに他に選択肢があるか？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Gikyo",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#089": {
   "src": "You can't possibly be that misguided! This isn't just Ophir's tragedy - all of us will be punished! Her Majesty won't stop at just a simple reprimand!",
   "dst": "まさかそこまで見当違いなはずがない！これは Ophir だけの悲劇ではない――私たち全員が罰を受けることになる！陛下は単なる叱責で済ませてはくれないだろう！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Gikyo",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#090": {
   "src": "... I'll be going. Haha! Feel free to drop by, if you ever fix that way of thinking!",
   "dst": "…じゃあ、行くね。はは！もしその考え方を改めることがあったら、いつでも気軽に遊びに来てね！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Gikyo",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#091": {
   "src": "... betray...? Betray Her Majesty, you say...?",
   "dst": "…裏切る…？　陛下を裏切る、と？…",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Azael",
   "note":""
  },
  "First Wicker's Spark#092": {
   "src": "You know, Gikyo... for someone so good at playing the fool, you really do have the brightest ideas sometimes...",
   "dst": "ねえ、 Gikyo ……あんなに馬鹿を演じることが上手いくせに、時々本当に素晴らしいアイデアを思いつくんだね……",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "First Wicker's Spark",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker":"Azael",
   "note":""
  }
 }
